          "@value": "Read every CodeSystem concept out of a FHIR IG clone checked out at its pinned tag and write a `folio-pinned-terminology/v1` snapshot: the offline, version-fixed answer `check:term-mapping` resolves its `fhir` target against. Which IG, which pin record and which snapshot path are the caller's (`--pin`, `--out`, `--source`); this layer names none (#1767, stage B′)."
        }
